Cleric Druid Shaman Ranger Wizard Magician Enchanter Necromancer Beastlord  <br>Races: All Races  <br> <br>and grats out to LUCANE on his:<br><br>Infestation <br>LORE ITEM MAGIC ITEM NO DROP  <br>Damage: 9<br>Delay: 18 <br>Ratio: 2 Excellent <br>Dex: +6 Poison Resist: +20  <br>Weight: 3.0 <br>Weapon Skill: Piercing <br>Classes: Ranger Bard Rogue Warrior  <br>Races: All Races  <br>Effect: Poison <br> <br>and finally grats HEXUM on your:<br><br>Chelaki Tail   <br>LORE ITEM MAGIC ITEM NO DROP  <br>Damage: 9<br>Delay: 19 <br>Weight: 3.5 <br>Classes: Warrior Rogue Bard Shadowknight Paladin Ranger  <br>Races: All Races  <br>Effect: Strong Disease <br> <br>  <br> <br><br>                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               